info.description:
WebSocket endpoint: ws://127.0.0.1:8000/ws?token=<accessToken> (or Authorization: Bearer). Run 'Login' to capture {{accessToken}}, then connect a WS client.

INBOUND frames (client -> server, JSON text):
  {"action":"ping"}
  {"action":"subscribe","channel":"incident:<uuid>"}
  {"action":"unsubscribe","channel":"<channel>"}
  {"action":"location","incident_id":"<uuid>","lat":14.5,"lng":120.9,"captured_at":"2026-06-23T08:00:00Z","accuracy_m":8.0}

CHANNELS: incident:<uuid>, agency:<agency>, role:<role>, org:<uuid>.
AUTH: admin may join any; incident:<id> requires agency visibility; role:/agency:/org: must match the caller's own.

OUTBOUND frames (server -> client):
  {"type":"connected","user_id":...,"role":...}        on connect
  {"type":"pong"}                                         reply to ping
  {"type":"ping"}                                         server heartbeat (~30s)
  {"type":"subscribed"|"unsubscribed","channel":...}
  {"type":"location_recorded","incident_id":...}         ack for a location frame
  {"type":"error","message":...}
  BROADCASTS on incident:<id>:
    {"type":"incident_verified|incident_rejected|incident_resolved|responder_dispatched|dispatch_withdrawn|incident_en_route|incident_arrived","incident_id":...,"status":...,"incident":{...}}
    {"type":"responder_location","incident_id":...,"responder_id":...,"lat":...,"lng":...,...}
  BROADCASTS on agency:<agency>:
    {"type":"incident_feed","event":...,"incident_id":...,"designation":...,"status":...,"alarm_level":...,"active_dispatch_count":...}
